sequenceDiagram
  participant Worker
  participant Redis
  participant Handler
  loop until shutdown or max items
    Worker->>Redis: ZRANGEBYSCORE schedule, now, limit 1
    Worker->>Redis: SPOP schedule key
    Worker->>Worker: unserialize and send again
    Worker->>Redis: SPOP the first selected priority set that returns a member
    Redis-->>Worker: serialized message or nothing
    Worker->>Handler: callback message, priority
  end
